  "description": "Library that provides a set of tools and components to help developers build Backend for Frontend (BFF) applications using ASP.NET Core. It aims to simplify the process of creating BFF layers by offering pre-built functionalities and best practices. This package is built on top of .NETCore and YARP and leverages Microsoft's OpenIdConnect library.\n\nIt's been built also with best security practices in mind.",
